                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Greely isn't in combat, and a PC has missed or forgotten a key piece of information</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Greely can step in to provide additional information or context, or remind the PCs of something they learned but appear to have forgotten, provided the information in question has something to do with history, Absalom's society, or one of Greely's Lore skills. Once he provides this aid, he grows smug and disdainful, and won't provide Additional Information again for the remainder of the day unless, at your discretion, the PCs really need the extra hint.</p>"
